title: 进军柏林
subtitle: 右翼武装分子正在行动……
view-if: ((((spd_in_government = 1 and coup_progress >= 10) or (coup_progress >= 15)) and year >= 1929 and (year >= 1930 or month >= 6) and ((sa_banned=0 or sh_banned=0) or (sa_force + sh_force + army_force*(1-reichswehr_loyalty) >= 50))) or (year >= 1933 and month >= 2 and chancellor != "Papen" and chancellor != "Schleicher" and coup_progress >= 6 and president == "Braun" and nsdap_votes + dnvp_votes + (sa_force+sh_force)/4 >= 50)) and march_on_berlin_timer = 0 and (nsdap_votes + sa_force + vienna_influence < dnvp_votes + other_votes + dvp_votes + sh_force) and chancellor_party != "DNVP"
new-page: true
max-visits: 4
on-arrival: seldte_march = 1; march_on_berlin_seen += 1; sa_strength += 40; sh_strength += 120; strife += 1; march_on_berlin_timer += 8
go-to: ask_resign if spd_in_government and (president != "Braun" and president != "Schumacher" and president != "Juchacz" and president != "Thälmann" and president != "Münzenberg" and president != "Adenauer" and (president != "Gessler" or reichswehr_loyalty < 0.2)); govt_menu if president = "Braun" or president = "Schumacher" or president = "Juchacz"; non_govt_menu if spd_in_government = 0 and (president != "Braun" and president != "Schumacher" and president != "Juchacz" and president != "Adenauer" and president != "Thälmann" and president != "Münzenberg" and (president != "Gessler" or reichswehr_loyalty < 0.2)); presidential_support if (president == "Gessler" and reichswehr_loyalty >= 0.2) or president == "Adenauer" or president == "Thälmann" or president == "Münzenberg"
tags: event
call: will_anschluss

= 进军柏林

极右翼正在动员。钢盔团与冲锋队的准军事力量在哈茨堡阵线的组织下向柏林进军,威胁要以暴力推翻政府。

他们要求或是立即举行由民族主义准军事组织「监督」的选举,或是政府立即辞职并任命一个由钢盔团的弗朗茨·泽尔特领衔的哈茨堡阵线内阁。显而易见,若其要求得不到满足,他们便以内战相威胁。

[? if anschluss_attempt : 与此同时,奥地利军队与冲锋队的力量利用这场政变之机越过边境进入巴伐利亚,与当地的政府军交战。民主正遭受一场大规模进攻。 ?]

@non_govt_menu

看来 [+ president +] 总统正对法西斯分子的提议持赞许态度。[+ chancellor +] 总理已宣布打算辞职。

- @fight
- @accept

@accept
title: 我们无能为力。
go-to: accept_seldte

@accept_seldte
on-arrival: chancellor = "Seldte"; chancellor_party = "DNVP"; labor_minister_party = "I"; interior_minister_party = "DNVP"; finance_minister_party = "I"; justice_minister_party = "DNVP"; economic_minister_party = "I"; foreign_minister_party = "I"; agriculture_minister_party = "DNVP"; reichswehr_minister_party = "I"; spd_in_government = 0; harzburg_r = dnvp_r; harzburg_r += other_r; harzburg_r += 3; harzburg_r += dvp_r if dvp_relation + pro_republic < 85; harzburg_r += z_minus_bvp_r if z_relation + pro_republic < 60 and z_party_leader != "Joos"; coup_progress *= 0.6
go-to: harzburg_collapse if harzburg_r < 50; harzburg_survive if harzburg_r >= 50

在总理辞职之后,钢盔团领袖弗朗茨·泽尔特被任命为总理,领衔一个高度反动的哈茨堡阵线内阁,陆军将领库尔特·冯·施莱谢尔则出任国防部长。尽管有此进展,纳粹党仍拒绝支持或加入政府,使哈茨堡阵线的团结趋于紧张。

@harzburg_collapse
go-to: new_elections_2

由于政变上台的政府仅有 [+ harzburg_r +]% 的支持,一场不信任案很快便把这个少数派哈茨堡内阁拉下台。尽管这场政变尚未导致民主的彻底毁灭,钢盔团却在此期间严酷迫害政治左翼;而反动派持续的少数派法令统治,则有可能推翻我们的许多改革。

# todo: seldte reichsexekutes prussia? martial law?

@harzburg_survive
on-arrival: anschluss_attempted = 1 if anschluss_attempt == 1; anschluss_attempt = 0

不知怎的,哈茨堡内阁竟在国会凑出了 [+ harzburg_r +]% 的多数,在不信任案中幸存下来。钢盔团随即开始严酷迫害政治左翼,而国家对此视而不见;我们在政府中所推行的进步改革也一一被撤销。

[? if anschluss_attempted : 与此同时,希特勒取消了奥地利那场短暂的入侵 —— 他似乎已认识到自己无力掌控局势。 ?]

@ask_resign

[+ president +] 总统已要求我们的政府辞职。

- @fight
- @fight_constitution
- @resign

